y":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,60,52,50,54,62],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1015805","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[62,60,52,50,54,62],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1015805","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"大伽倻（高灵伽倻）第一代国王。伊珍阿豉王一作內珍朱智，《新增東国輿地勝览》引崔致远《释利貞传》高灵郡背後伽倻山的山神正見母主，与天神夷毗訶之生二子，长子惱窒朱日（伊珍阿豉王ㆍ內督朱智），建立大加羅，次子惱窒青裔（首露王）建立金官伽倻，大伽倻因为是长兄称大，盟主为金官国。大伽倻国自始祖伊珍阿豉王至道设智王，传十六世王，五百二十年。","tc":"大伽倻（高靈伽倻）第一代國王。伊珍阿豉王一作內珍朱智，《新增東國輿地勝覽》引崔致遠《釋利貞傳》高靈郡背後伽倻山的山神正見母主，與天神夷毗訶之生二子，長子惱窒朱日（伊珍阿豉王ㆍ內督朱智），建立大加羅，次子惱窒青裔（首露王）建立金官伽倻，大伽倻因為是長兄稱大，盟主為金官國。大伽倻國自始祖伊珍阿豉王至道設智王，傳十六世王，五百二十年。","en":"The first king of Daegaya (Goryeong Gaya). King Ijinasi was also known as Naejinjuji. The Sinjeung Dongguk Yeoji Seungnam, quoting Choe Chi-won's Biography of Seok Ijeong, records that Jeonggyeon Moju, the mountain goddess of Mount Gaya behind Goryeong County, bore two sons to the heavenly god Ibihaji. The elder son, Noejil Juil (King Ijinasi, also called Naedokjuji), established Daegaya (Dae-Gara), while the younger son, Noejil Cheong-ye (King Suro), founded Geumgwan Gaya. Daegaya took the title ‘Dae’ (Great) because it was founded by the elder brother, though the leader of the confederacy was the Geumgwan state. From its founder King Ijinasi to King Doseolji, Daegaya spanned sixteen generations of kings and endured for 520 years.","jp":"大加耶（高霊加耶）の初代国王。伊珍阿豉王は内珍朱智とも称される。『新增東国輿地勝覧』が引用する崔致遠の『釈利貞伝』によれば、高霊郡の背後にある伽耶山の山神・正見母主が天神の夷毘訶之との間に二子をもうけ、長男の悩窒朱日（伊珍阿豉王・内督朱智）が大加羅を建て、次男の悩窒青裔（首露王）が金官加耶を建てたとされる。大加耶は長兄の国であったため「大」と称されたが、盟主は金官国であった。大加耶国は始祖・伊珍阿豉王から道設智王に至るまで、十六代・五百二十年続いた。","kr":"대가야(고령가야)의 제1대 국왕. 이진아시왕은 내진주지(內珍朱智)라고도 한다. 《신증동국여지승람》에 인용된 최치원의 《석이정전》에 따르면 고령군 뒤편 가야산의 산신 정견모주(正見母主)가 천신 이비가지(夷毗訶之)와 혼인하여 두 아들을 낳았는데, 장남인 뇌질주일(이진아시왕·내독주지)은 대가라를 건국하고 차남인 뇌질청예(수로왕)는 금관가야를 건국하였다고 전한다. 대가야는 맏형이 세운 나라라 하여 '대(大)'라 칭하였으나, 맹주는 금관국이었다. 대가야국은 시조 이진아시왕부터 도설지왕까지 16대 520년간 존속하였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1050115","remark":"统帅","surname":"","surnameTc":"","surnameEn":"","surnameJp":"","surnameKr":"","surnameOther":"","name":"伊珍阿豉","nameTc":"伊珍阿豉","nameEn":"Ijinasi","nameJp":"伊珍阿豉","nameKr":"이진아시","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"伊珍阿豉","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"190","city":"CS1068","gender":"0","rule":"62","force":"60","wise":"52","politics":"50","charm":"54","will":"62","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"30/24/60/32/30/25/31/31","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6200","battleSoulPoint":"7700","debateSoulPoint":"3200","strategy":"","strategy2":"1008501","professions":"2/3/3/2/0/0/2/0/1/1/0/0/2/2/1/0/2/1/1/1/0/2/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"95","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"1300","title":"1","rank":"1","birth":"42","show":"56","death":"190","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1015805","helmet":"WP1026405","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;10/1;3/1;25/1;30/1;44/1;46/0;42/0","father